  "job_B3.3.17.2_20261117_184339": {
    "chunk_text": "onfeng in Turnan \u00f0\u00e6re byrig, nis n\u00e6nig man \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea wundor ealle & \u00f0eah he \u00fea maran had h\u00e6fde, & eac for worlde ricra beon sceolde, \u00feonne he \u00e6r w\u00e6re, \u00feeh hwe\u00fere & he his bisceophad swa gedefelice for Gode geheold swa he hwe\u00fere n\u00e6fde \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6gen & \u00fea Omnes namque unanimiter cupiebant; Ond ealle men forneah, \u00f0a \u00fee \u00f0yses eadygan weres lif cu\u00feon W\u00e6s he for\u00f0on swi\u00fee m\u00e6re geond middangeard, & he manig templ & deofolgyld gebr\u00e6c & gefylde, \u00d0\u00e6t gelamp sume si\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t he ongan b\u00e6rnan sum deofolgild, \u00fee mid \u00fe\u00e6m h\u00e6\u00f0num mannum swi\u00f0e \u00dea stod \u00f0\u00e6r sum nytwyr\u00f0e hus bi \u00fe\u00e6m gilde \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6r b\u00e6rnan ongan. \u00d0a slog se wind \u00feone leg on \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00feer hus, & \u00f0uhte \u00fe\u00e6t hit eal forbyrnan sceolde. \u00dea he \u00fea Sanctus Martinus \u00fe\u00e6t geseah, \u00fea arn he sona up on \u00fe\u00e6t hus, & \u00f0a gestod ongean \u00fe\u00e6m lege. \u00dea gelamp wundorlic wyrd \u00fe\u00e6t se leg ongan slean & brecan ongean \u00feone wind, & efne swa se wind & swa se leg wear\u00f0 ge\u00fereatod \u00feurh Sancte Martines gebedu, \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6nigum o\u00f0rum \u00e6rne sce\u00fe\u00fean ne Swilce gelamp eft o\u00feer wunder \u00f0ysum onlic. He com to sumum tune \u00f0e Librassa w\u00e6s haten; \u00f0a w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r gild \u00fee \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feen",
